1
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:11,000
"Flame Book"

2
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:18,280
Now there are only two contestants left
from the same school.

3
00:00:18,280 --> 00:00:21,631
And this question will determine
who becomes the winner.

4
00:00:21,631 --> 00:00:26,220
Our next question is from
the Biology category.

5
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:31,811
Endosymbiosis — which organelle
is involved in this process?

6
00:00:31,811 --> 00:00:35,322
If you're ready…
your time starts now.

7
00:00:39,440 --> 00:00:41,832
I now have both answers in my hand.

8
00:00:41,832 --> 00:00:44,091
The correct answer is…

9
00:00:48,662 --> 00:00:52,900
Chloroplast. Congratulations
to our winner, Narongsak.

10
00:00:57,719 --> 00:01:00,755
Congrats on being the national academic champion.

11
00:01:00,755 --> 00:01:05,491
Seriously, why did you answer like that?
You knew the right one, didn't you?

12
00:01:06,332 --> 00:01:10,562
Why did you choose the wrong answer?
Heh… I really didn't know.

13
00:01:12,656 --> 00:01:16,411
Book… want to grab lunch with me?

14
00:01:20,560 --> 00:01:23,681
Uh… about that movie
I asked you to watch together.

15
00:01:25,240 --> 00:01:26,840
You still haven't replied to me.

16
00:01:32,280 --> 00:01:35,573
So… what do you think?
Will you go with me?

17
00:01:37,560 --> 00:01:41,242
I don't like you… I'm sorry.
I already like someone else.
